### Create a workout — expect 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Chest",
  "performedAt": "2026-10-06T13:25"
}

### Get my workouts — expect 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts


### Get one of my workouts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/1